From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Murray <5672686+JRMurr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:59:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Gaze: FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS runs gaze/build's programs on the
 host

ft-gazed and gazecheck.py ran ft-gaze and ft-gazepanel in the dev container.
With FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS=1 they run directly (gazecal.build_argv).
---
 gaze/ft-gazed               | 13 +++++++------
 gaze/gazecal.py             | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 gaze/gazecheck.py           |  6 ++----
 gaze/test_gazecal_builds.py | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 gaze/test_gazecal_builds.py

